    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey where destiny and choices intertwine. <i>Amara: Demon Will</i> is a captivating pixel action game that blends an emotional narrative with immersive exploration.<br>Play as Amara, a white-haired girl, traveling through a mystical world filled with enigmas. Engage in combat with swift dodges, unleash powerful skills, and unravel the secrets hidden in ancient ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make shapes your future:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Combat and Strategy</strong>: Defeat formidable enemies through a fluid combat system and dynamic skill combinations.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Emotion and Decisions</strong>: Face inner struggles and make choices with profound consequences on an unpredictable journey.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Pixel Art and Atmosphere</strong>: Discover a fantastical world brought to life with intricate pixel art and an evocative original soundtrack.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you evade the darkness or confront it? Will you succumb or rise above? Your story is yours to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975290/extras/568a2ee40473ea9c9e3aecc4eeb07dfb.avif?t=1748424318\" data-has-big width=800 height=348 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey where destiny and choices intertwine. <i>Amara: Demon Will</i> is a captivating pixel action game that blends an emotional narrative with immersive exploration.<br>Play as Amara, a white-haired girl, traveling through a mystical world filled with enigmas. Engage in combat with swift dodges, unleash powerful skills, and unravel the secrets hidden in ancient ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make shapes your future:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Combat and Strategy</strong>: Defeat formidable enemies through a fluid combat system and dynamic skill combinations.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Emotion and Decisions</strong>: Face inner struggles and make choices with profound consequences on an unpredictable journey.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Pixel Art and Atmosphere</strong>: Discover a fantastical world brought to life with intricate pixel art and an evocative original soundtrack.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you evade the darkness or confront it? Will you succumb or rise above? Your story is yours to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975290/extras/568a2ee40473ea9c9e3aecc4eeb07dfb.avif?t=1748424318\" data-has-big width=800 height=348 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;AMARA: DEMON WILL&quot; is a pixel action game where you follow a white-haired girl on a journey to unravel the chains of fate. Every choice comes with a cost \u2014 will you flee from the darkness, or face the fear within? Each decision may lead to new hope and strength.",
